  <regions type="content">
    <region left="0" top="0" width="754" height="53" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="background-color: #ffff80;">
            <span style="font-weight: bold; background-color: #ffff80;">Review the datasheet and application note of the TJA1100 within a temperature range of -40°C to +85°C:</span>
            <br />
            <br />Dratasheet: TJA1100 DatasheetLinks to an external site. Application Note: TJA1100 Application NoteLinks to an external site.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="72" width="775" height="83" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="775" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="background-color: #ffff80;">1. Identify the power supply architecture<br />The application note (AN12088) suggests various power supply architectures. We recommend following Figure 6.<br /><br />The LDO will be powered by a switched source with a 4.7V output, fluctuating within ±100mV, and a switching frequency of 500KHz.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="153" width="221" height="108" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="270" width="574" height="23" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="background-color: #ffff80;">2. **Identify minimum, typical, and maximum voltages and currents consumed by the TJA1100.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="306" width="769" height="145" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="450" width="773" height="164" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="999" width="740" height="38" color="#000000" bgColor="#ffff80" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="background-color: #ffff80;">3. **Analyze if the LDO can dissipate the current consumed by the IC. If it's marginal, explain strategies to improve thermal performance.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="72" top="1035" width="612" height="73" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1107" width="517" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Initial LDO selected datasheet: https://www.onsemi.com/pdf/datasheet/ncp700b-d.pdf</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1125" width="111" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Vldo.in</e>
          <e type="operand">4.8</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="126" top="1125" width="117" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Vldo.out</e>
          <e type="operand">3.3</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1143" width="231" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">V.drop</e>
          <e type="operand">Vldo.in</e>
          <e type="operand">Vldo.out</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">-</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">1.5</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">V</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="333" top="1170" width="102" height="41" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">RθJA</e>
          <e type="operand">204</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">W</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1179" width="122" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Imax</e>
          <e type="operand">168.5</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mA</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="144" top="1179" width="175" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Tamb</e>
          <e type="operand">85</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">°C</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">358.15</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1197" width="200" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">P</e>
          <e type="operand">V.drop</e>
          <e type="operand">Imax</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">mW</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">252.75</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1215" width="175" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">ΔT</e>
          <e type="operand">P</e>
          <e type="operand">RθJA</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">51.561</e>
