    <region left="0" top="1422" width="728" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>The LDO cannot dissipate the current consumed by the TJA1100, but calculations were done using the referenced RθJA.<br /></p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1449" width="785" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>At an ambient temperature of 85 °C, maintaining a 10 °C margin below the 125 °C junction temperature limit requires a junction-to-ambient thermal resistance of 118.7 K/W or less. The TSOP-5 copper layouts shown in Figure 58 exceed this value, so an LDO with lower thermal resistance is required for this design target.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1503" width="74" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math optimize="2">
        <input>
          <e type="operand">ΔT</e>
          <e type="operand">30</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="396" top="1512" width="320" height="53" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Part number changed to fulfill the power dissipation requiremetns <br />https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps7a21-q1.pdf</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1521" width="180" height="41" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">RθJA</e>
          <e type="operand">ΔT</e>
          <e type="operand">P</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">W</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">118.6944</e>
        </result>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="1557" width="304" height="228" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="396" top="1557" width="377" height="132" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="396" top="1656" width="102" height="41" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">RθJA</e>
          <e type="operand">224</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">W</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">/</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="396" top="1692" width="175" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">ΔT</e>
          <e type="operand">P</e>
          <e type="operand">RθJA</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
        <contract>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">K</e>
        </contract>
        <result action="numeric">
          <e type="operand">56.616</e>
